Error [E0102]: An element of `items` has no method `nothing_here`
  --> variadic_bound_uncalled_body_is_checked.jet:12:14
    |
 12 |         item.nothing_here()
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Each element of `items` is known only through its bounds (`Edit` + `Inspect`), and none of them provides `nothing_here`
 Fix: Call a method from `Edit` + `Inspect`, or add a trait that defines `nothing_here` to `items`'s bound list
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102
